\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Detailed architectural topologies of the three proposed algorithmic modules: (a) Spectral Band Attention Module (SBAM) dynamically attenuating noisy atmospheric absorption bands on raw input cubes, (b) Complementary Branch Spectral Attention (CBSA) enforcing orthogonal specialization between dual 3D convolutional streams, and (c) Second-Order Covariance Fusion Gate (SCFG) capturing localized spatial-channel co-activation statistics.}}{7}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:proposed_modules}{{2}{7}{Detailed architectural topologies of the three proposed algorithmic modules: (a) Spectral Band Attention Module (SBAM) dynamically attenuating noisy atmospheric absorption bands on raw input cubes, (b) Complementary Branch Spectral Attention (CBSA) enforcing orthogonal specialization between dual 3D convolutional streams, and (c) Second-Order Covariance Fusion Gate (SCFG) capturing localized spatial-channel co-activation statistics}{figure.caption.3}{}}
